sources:
  - kind: other
    path: soc/qcom/msm8909/harness/patches
    derived:
      - 0101-arm-msm8909-support.patch
    note: >-
      Original gki_world work for the MSM8909 dev second stage.  The patch adds
      an ARMv7 machine (the SoC has no AArch64 mode, unlike U-Boot's existing
      ARCH_SNAPDRAGON targets), binds the MSM8909 GCC to the existing stub clock
      provider, and makes the existing Snapdragon LMB ceiling apply here.
notes: >-
  The patch applies after the global gkiw patches to the pinned U-Boot commit
  in global/harness/2ndstage/uboot.conf.
